<title>UK: BFG Hypo sets 500 million mark seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BFG Hypo sets 500 million mark seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    02.AUG.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES UNDISCLOSED</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (k) 1</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
